              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "None rero, yemwe Bisirayeli, mbega har’ ikindi Uhoraho Imana yanyu abagombako, atar’ ukumwubaha, no kugendera mu nzira ziwe zose, no kumukunda, no kumukorera n’imitima yanyu yose n’ubugingo bganyu bgose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
