        },
        {
          "text": "Kuk’ Uhoraho Imana yanyu ar’ Imana isumba izindi, n’Umwami asumba abandi, n’ Imana ihambaye, n’Inyabushobozi iteye ubgoba, idatinya abantu ku kigohe, itarya ingurire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.10.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
